{"product":{"id":10065157128480,"title":"Peyote XC Trail","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnparalleled performance in fine loose conditions.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePeyote XC Trail delivers blazing speed and control when you ride fine loose terrain, and is built for riders who chase adventure and podiums in equal measure. Its revolutionary tread design features a fast-rolling alternating center ribbon for maximum efficiency, while the signature Vittoria V-formation channels away debris to maintain relentless traction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn alternating mid-tread tapers seamlessly into capable cornering lugs, giving Peyote XC Trail predictable, responsive handling and the confidence to push harder through every turn.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerformance goes even deeper with Vittoria’s 4Compound Formulation, which strategically places four optimized rubber compounds exactly where they’re needed. The result is an unrivaled fusion of speed, grip, and durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt on our advanced Trail casing, this tire balances low weight with toughness: a tubeless-ready nylon construction reinforced with sidewall protection and an anti-puncture belt—confidence for every line you choose.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"MTB Tire","created_at":"2025-10-02T21:14:06-05:00","handle":"peyote-xc-trail","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:08:36-05:00","published_at":"2025-11-18T09:05:52-06:00","template_suffix":"xc-trail-template","published_scope":"global","tags":"Cross Country, Discounted products, EP70, IPP40, MTB, Sitewide, Tires, Trail Case, XC\/Down Country","variants":[{"id":50758679036192,"product_id":10065157128480,"title":"29x2.1 \/ Black","price":"96.99","sku":"11A00749","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"29x2.1","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-10-02T21:14:06-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:0